; Hand-drawn furniture in the interior_ref style (top slab + front face, coloured outlines); each piece sits bottom-centred on a 48x48 cell.
name furniture
size 48 48
scale 2
outline O A
layout
bed desk table chair_s chair_n chair_e bookshelf sofa lamp plant chair_w
palette
O #5e3d26 wood outline
D #8a5a36 wood shade
M #b07a46 wood
L #cf9c68 wood light (top surfaces)
A #2f4a78 fabric outline
B #4a6fa5 fabric
C #6f93c8 fabric light
P #eef0f4 sheet / paper
Q #c9cfdc sheet shade
G #3f7a36 leaf
H #6fa552 leaf light
R #b4553a terracotta / red book
S #d9774f terracotta light
Y #d9b15a lamp shade / yellow book
Z #f3d98a lamp shade light

